# The conformance goldens are compared against text this repository generates,
# and the generator always writes LF. Checking them out as CRLF on Windows
# makes `conformance:update` rewrite the whole file for no reason, and made the
# comparison fail until the runner started normalising on read.
#
# Pinning the checkout is the other half of that fix: normalise on read so a
# stale checkout still passes, and pin here so it never happens again.
*.json    text eol=lf
*.ts      text eol=lf
*.md      text eol=lf
*.html    text eol=lf

# Never touched by line-ending conversion.
*.pdf     binary
*.png     binary
